      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can confirm, i was able to rip one of my avatars and a public one without modifying the vrc client and with minimal effort. It's extremely easy to rip a complete model with almost all assets 1:1 and even more easy to peek at all avatar parts without any client modification. that should not be the case imo. i was also able to rip one world, this should also not be possible in the best case.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "60480ef40441770e570fedea",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5fafbc5d0241416661e39ee1",
        "alias": "Nutmeg Boa",
        "aliasID": "65c2c026ed6eefce4c64670f",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/5288af593165548e44956bf0d5cda53d.png",
        "created": "2020-11-14T11:15:41.569Z",
        "name": "Hitori Ou",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62f2b3cf8f8367753b2f0",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2021-03-10T00:12:36.096Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
