      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fafbc5d0241416661e39ee1|full_name}: i had that streaming idea many months ago. With the whole game, but: Why not \"simply\" stream the avatars? make a websocket conn to a server and only render a 3d canvas onto a generic sizable mesh. I dont know if such technique exists, but it should be possible in theory to only stream the image, the simplest way would be a 2d canvas. but worlds would still be a problem though.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
