  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's very easy for someone to rip your VRchat avatar, and it literally doesn't take much effort from what I've heard people say.\nThe VRchat api is incredibly insecure and it would be amazing if you guys prevented avatar ripping. Thank you.",
